### Color palette

Use these colors consistently throughout the website:

- Blush pink: #F4DDE1
- Warm ivory: #F8F2E8
- Sage green: #DCE6D9
- Soft lavender: #DCCBE5
- Champagne beige: #E8D8C5
- Deep cocoa brown: #493B3B
